- F-338 **The code generator compiles an object or trait whose first supertrait is an imported api's trait, also where a later supertrait gives a same-named method.** `dumpMethodChaining` reads the first supertrait's methods through `CodeGen.firstSupertraitMethods`, which gives each of the supertrait's own declarations the trait's name as the extends clause writes it; `STypesUtil.allMethods` already gives them that name (F-391), so this renaming changes no entry. Test: `TraitTableApiTraitCompiled`. Detail: `compile-ladder/rung-codegen-trait-table/REPORT.md`, sections 1, 2 and 6.
